export anchor DesignEditor:
    description:
        Brightwork Canvas, the suite's design tool, editing the file Website
        redesign, page Home v3. Treat it as a desktop app; on a phone it shows
        a simplified view with the canvas and a bottom toolbar.

    toolbar:
        Move, Frame, Rectangle, Text, Pen and Hand tools with Move selected, a
        zoom of 66 percent, Share and Present buttons, and avatars for Priya
        Nair, Mara Okafor and Aiko Tanaka showing who is in the file.

    layersPanel:
        - Hero, a frame, selected
        - Headline text, "Every project, on one calm page"
        - Subline text
        - Primary button, a component instance
        - Product screenshot, an image
        - Logo strip, a frame
        - Features, a frame, collapsed

    canvas:
        The Hero frame at 1440 by 820, showing the headline, a button and a
        screenshot placeholder, with selection handles and a 32 px spacing
        guide. A comment pin from Priya Nair says "Try the button in brand
        green?".

    inspector:
        For the selected frame, X 0, Y 0, W 1440, H 820, a fill of #FFFFFF,
        auto layout vertical with 32 gap and 96 padding, corner radius 0, and
        an export section with PNG at 2x.

    statusBar:
        Saved 2 minutes ago, 3 people editing, version 41.
